                "description": "Kwikset DNL Dorian Lever - Kwikset's Dorian leverset is designed with heavy influence from the old world. The unique shape is reminiscent of a time when elegance and embellishment graced everything. It is available as in a passage, privacy, keyed entry and dummy functions. This leverset will fit 1-3/8 inch and 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses with an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
